- The integer array parameter `nums` must not be null.
- The integer result is the sum of the contiguous subarray within the integer array parameter `nums` that has the largest sum.
- The contiguous subarray must contain at least one number.
- The contiguous subarray is a contiguous part of the integer array parameter `nums`.
- If there are multiple contiguous subarrays with the largest sum, any of them can be returned as the result.